CORE
sva_until2.sv
--bound 6 --numbered-trace
^\[main\.p0\] main\.x <= 2 until main\.x == 4: REFUTED$
^\[main\.p1\] main\.x <= 2 s_until main\.x == 4: REFUTED$
^\[main\.p2\] main\.x <= 2 until_with main\.x == 4: REFUTED$
^\[main\.p3\] main\.x <= 2 s_until_with main\.x == 4: REFUTED$
^Counterexample with 4 states:$
^main\.x@3 = 4'b0011$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^Counterexample with [123] states?:$
^warning: ignoring
--
The counterexamples extend to the state with x == 3, in which the
properties are violated.
